const defs=[{id:'blipscreator',name:'Blips Creator',icon:'⌖',fields:[['name','Name'],['sprite','Sprite','number'],['color','Farbe','number'],['scale','Größe','number'],['x','X','number'],['y','Y','number'],['z','Z','number'],['short_range','Nur in der Nähe','checkbox'],['enabled','Aktiviert','checkbox']]},{id:'elevator',name:'Fahrstuhl',icon:'⇅',fields:[['name','Name'],['description','Beschreibung'],['job_name','Job'],['required_grade','Mindest-Rang','number'],['enabled','Aktiviert','checkbox']]},{id:'logging',name:'Logging',icon:'▤',fields:[['name','Name'],['event_key','Event-Schlüssel'],['description','Beschreibung'],['enabled','Aktiviert','checkbox']]},{id:'teleport',name:'Teleport',icon:'↗',fields:[['name','Name'],['x','X','number'],['y','Y','number'],['z','Z','number'],['heading','Heading','number'],['job_name','Job'],['required_grade','Mindest-Rang','number'],['enabled','Aktiviert','checkbox']]},{id:'klingel',name:'Klingelsystem',icon:'♧',fields:[['name','Name'],['x','X','number'],['y','Y','number'],['z','Z','number'],['radius','Radius','number'],['cooldown_seconds','Cooldown','number'],['job_name','Empfänger-Job'],['enabled','Aktiviert','checkbox']]}];let allowed=[],active='dashboard',rows=[],edit=null,search='';const esc=s=>String(s??'').replace(/[&<>]/g,c=>c==='&'?'&amp;':c==='<'?'&lt;':'&gt;');const root=document.querySelector('#root'),api=async(action,p={})=>{const r=await fetch('https://'+GetParentResourceName()+'/request',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({action,...p})});const j=await r.json();if(!j.success)throw Error(j.message||'Fehler');return j},m=()=>defs.find(x=>x.id===active);function render(){const d=m();root.innerHTML='<main class="shell"><aside class="sidebar"><div class="brand"><b class="brand-mark">LV</b><div><strong>LODGE V</strong><small>DEVELOPER PANEL</small></div></div><div class="nav-label">ÜBERSICHT</div><button class="nav-item" data-nav="dashboard">▦ <span>Dashboard</span></button><div class="nav-label">MODULE</div>'+defs.filter(x=>allowed.includes(x.id)).map(x=>'<button class="nav-item" data-nav="'+x.id+'">'+x.icon+' <span>'+x.name+'</span></button>').join('')+'<div class="sidebar-footer">LODGE V · DEVELOPMENT</div></aside><section class="content"><header class="topbar"><div><span class="eyebrow">SYSTEMVERWALTUNG</span><h1>'+(d?d.name:'Developer Panel')+'</h1></div><button class="secondary" id="close">Schließen ✕</button></header>'+(d?'<div class="toolbar"><input id="search" placeholder="Einträge durchsuchen..." value="'+esc(search)+'"><button class="primary" id="add">＋ Neuer Eintrag</button></div><div class="table-card"><div class="table-head"><h3>'+d.name+' · '+rows.length+' Einträge</h3><button class="secondary" id="refresh">↻ Aktualisieren</button></div><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>ID</th>'+d.fields.slice(0,4).map(f=>'<th>'+f[1]+'</th>').join('')+'<th>Aktionen</th></tr></thead><tbody>'+rows.filter(r=>JSON.stringify(r).toLowerCase().includes(search.toLowerCase())).map(r=>'<tr><td>#'+r.id+'</td>'+d.fields.slice(0,4).map(f=>'<td>'+esc(r[f[0]]??'—')+'</td>').join('')+'<td><button data-edit="'+r.id+'">Bearbeiten</button> <button data-del="'+r.id+'">Löschen</button></td></tr>').join('')+'</tbody></table></div>'+(!rows.length?'<p class="empty">Keine Einträge vorhanden.</p>':'')+'</div>':'<section class="welcome"><span class="eyebrow orange">LODGE V DEVELOPMENT</span><h2>Zentrale Verwaltung</h2><p>Wähle einen Modulbereich.</p></section><div class="module-grid">'+defs.filter(x=>allowed.includes(x.id)).map(x=>'<button class="module-card" data-nav="'+x.id+'"><b>'+x.icon+'</b>'+x.name+' →</button>').join('')+'</div>')+'<footer>LODGE V © 2026 <span>lv_dev · v0.3.0</span></footer></section></main>'+(edit&&d?'<div class="modal-backdrop"><form class="modal" id="form"><h2>'+(edit.id?'Eintrag bearbeiten':'Neuer Eintrag')+'</h2><div class="form-grid">'+d.fields.map(f=>'<label>'+f[1]+(f[2]==='checkbox'?'<input type="checkbox" name="'+f[0]+'" '+(edit[f[0]]?'checked':'')+'>':'<input name="'+f[0]+'" type="'+(f[2]||'text')+'" step="any" value="'+(edit[f[0]]??'')+'" '+(['name','x','y','z'].includes(f[0])?'required':'')+'>')+'</label>').join('')+'</div><div class="modal-actions"><button type="button" class="secondary" id="cancel">Abbrechen</button><button class="primary">Speichern</button></div></form></div>':'');root.querySelectorAll('[data-nav]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{active=b.dataset.nav;edit=null;rows=[];search='';render();if(active!=='dashboard')load()});root.querySelector('#close').onclick=()=>api('close');root.querySelector('#add')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{edit={};render()});root.querySelector('#refresh')?.addEventListener('click',load);root.querySelector('#search')?.addEventListener('input',e=>{search=e.target.value;render();const s=root.querySelector('#search');s.focus();s.setSelectionRange(search.length,search.length)});root.querySelector('#cancel')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{edit=null;render()});root.querySelectorAll('[data-edit]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{edit=rows.find(r=>r.id==b.dataset.edit);render()});root.querySelectorAll('[data-del]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=async()=>{if(confirm('Eintrag löschen?')){await api('delete',{module:active,data:{id:Number(b.dataset.del)}});load()}});root.querySelector('#form')?.addEventListener('submit',async e=>{e.preventDefault();const fd=new FormData(e.target),data={};d.fields.forEach(f=>data[f[0]]=f[2]==='checkbox'?fd.has(f[0]):f[2]==='number'?Number(fd.get(f[0])||0):String(fd.get(f[0])||''));await api(edit.id?'update':'create',{module:active,data:{...data,...(edit.id?{id:edit.id}:{})}});edit=null;load()})}async function load(){try{rows=(await api('list',{module:active})).data||[];render()}catch(e){alert(e.message)}}window.addEventListener('message',e=>{if(e.data?.type==='open'){document.body.classList.add('nui-open');allowed=e.data.modules||[];active='dashboard';render()}if(e.data?.type==='close'){document.body.classList.remove('nui-open');root.innerHTML=''}});window.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Escape')api('close')});